(1, 'Kej', 'Genesis', 4, 24, 'If Cain is avenged sevenfold,  
    truly Lamech seventy-sevenfold."', 'en', 'NRSV-CE', NULL),
(1, 'Kej', 'Genesis', 4, 25, 'Adam knew his wife again, and she bore a son and named him Seth, for she said, "God has appointed for me another child instead of Abel, because Cain killed him."', 'en', 'NRSV-CE', NULL),
(1, 'Kej', 'Genesis', 4, 26, 'To Seth also a son was born, and he named him Enosh. At that time people began to invoke the name of the LORD.', 'en', 'NRSV-CE', NULL);




